{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_033sih_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_033sih_002_1000_camman", "source_sha256": "7f239ce9621d243a08303d38042e134343627f5e1d8653bfccf558a6798c02f3", "ja": "志保ちゃん、肩の力を抜いて、\nもう少し楽にしてもらっていいですよ。", "zh": "志保妹妹，肩膀放松，\n不用这么紧张没关系喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_033sih_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_033sih_002_1001_033sih", "source_sha256": "a2c8df994dfab829f5203ad6554197f2c3623c524657767cd5575f02b0fee477", "ja": "はい……。", "zh": "好的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_033sih_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_033sih_002_1002_p", "source_sha256": "47c1d2b4c90dac7775213c4148bc47923175bd6ea2f437abf207eb55d0de7805", "ja": "（志保の宣材写真を撮りに来たんだけど……。\n志保、上手く表情を作れないみたいだな）", "zh": "（现在在拍志保的宣传照……\n但是她似乎不太会做表情。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_033sih_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_033sih_002_1003_p", "source_sha256": "63f7b0399a140d259813e7fcba4ec50be6e61ba667bcf586cdd0c07a3efb4bd7", "ja": "すみません。\n一度、休憩を挟ませてください。", "zh": "不好意思。\n请让我们休息一下。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_033sih_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_033sih_002_1004_033sih", "source_sha256": "8de8c241d369116e2ee3fa3e1d605b69305d4135c28ab74a26023893c1ed7ea8", "ja": "はぁ……。\nどうして、上手くいかないんだろ……。", "zh": "唉……\n为什么就是拍不好呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_033sih_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_033sih_002_1005_p", "source_sha256": "9799966c28bd6f4d44a21a7ea6ff0b9189213f005996db847c1fbc6e3da0bb3e", "ja": "志保、お疲れさま。\n調子はどうだ？", "zh": "志保，辛苦你了。\n状况如何？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_033sih_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_033sih_002_1006_033sih", "source_sha256": "0631cb2a072b2eff674c6e94c62373f8c6677ca26be6533f9ba269e44da31304", "ja": "そんなの、見ていればわかるじゃないですか。", "zh": "这种事情不用问也看得出来吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_033sih_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_033sih_002_1007_p", "source_sha256": "343584b54d79f0dffa6ff0d4024b3fe698af00c0a3108737ca6af48ecd07de0c", "ja": "はは、そうだな。\n……緊張してるのか？", "zh": "哈哈，说得也是。\n……你会紧张吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_033sih_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_033sih_002_1008_033sih", "source_sha256": "843e17a2f4b0081e2195fe5542c3ad5c129c890b2ce777e6ce7bf3f95d133744", "ja": "別に……。ただカメラを向けられると、\n変に意識しちゃって。笑顔が上手く作れないんです。", "zh": "还好……只是一站到相机前，\n我就会一直想着镜头，摆不出笑容。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_033sih_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_033sih_002_1009_p", "source_sha256": "ee6f3feb3ab3450fa4447fcb08362582aa7beac8683c884e085c1b1102c29995", "ja": "それなら、無理に作らなくても……。\n記念写真だと思って、普通に撮ってもらおう。", "zh": "既然如此，你也不用勉强自己……\n就当作是拍纪念照，自然地拍吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_033sih_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_033sih_002_1010_033sih", "source_sha256": "48c426e72df3dc568217b2cdf05b4d8d5e41704d4272adda1e7785b39545e888", "ja": "そういうわけにはいきません。\nいよいよアイドルとしての仕事が始まったんです。", "zh": "这怎么可以呢？\n我终于要开始做偶像的工作了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_033sih_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_033sih_002_1011_033sih", "source_sha256": "eb088055b1349d180edcb842c9531bbf9bdb55bc0180588cf590e43273874739", "ja": "仕事なのに手を抜くなんて、プロ失格です。", "zh": "在工作时敷衍了事，太不专业了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_033sih_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_033sih_002_1012_p", "source_sha256": "e5b432c5105301bdbb3f02843a1e61c4da8a6bd78c4d4e6ba7782004202881c5", "ja": "ああ、手を抜くのはよくないな。\nだからプロとして、全力で気楽にならないと。", "zh": "是啊，不可以敷衍了事。\n所以要拿出专业精神，尽全力放松。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_033sih_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_033sih_002_1013_033sih", "source_sha256": "4ae8c8a80c374d336d504ce90fd30902751e26429c90d47b34d3e1c7f58769fe", "ja": "……？\nどういうことですか？", "zh": "……？\n请问这是什么意思？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_033sih_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_033sih_002_1014_p", "source_sha256": "dcaf7d20720bc808b9f03dc98095f3118b2eef4f2e1347238be76286deeca050", "ja": "宣材写真は、志保を売り出すために使うものなんだ。\nつまり、志保の魅力が伝わるものじゃないといけない。", "zh": "宣传照是拿来推销志保用的。\n所以，必须要能表现出志保的魅力才行。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_033sih_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_033sih_002_1015_p", "source_sha256": "53a77e2067eba5e177641d9706ffb9eeb9e0d6461ae12347d02279cccca9b471", "ja": "アイドルとして、確かに笑顔は大切だけど……\n何も笑顔だけが、魅力的な表情ってわけじゃないし。", "zh": "笑容对偶像来说很重要没错……\n但不代表只有笑容才是有魅力的表情。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_033sih_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_033sih_002_1016_033sih", "source_sha256": "2e0487f1e4cd6fd90bc3ed3002c9be4d4166ef795d494ffb83f60be87d33dc57", "ja": "……私に、笑顔は似合わないってことですか？", "zh": "……请问你的意思是我不适合露出笑容吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_033sih_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_033sih_002_1017_p", "source_sha256": "4895e5b6e93b5b1d34a1831549f3188d9bf7f13427cac79e50a18ca8cf081310", "ja": "そうじゃないよ。\nただ、もっと志保らしい表情があると思うんだ。", "zh": "我不是那个意思啦。\n只是，我认为有其他表情更能表现志保的特色。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_033sih_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_033sih_002_1018_033sih", "source_sha256": "fe0baa09fe4ad23f6c2892fee05d6cfb1629f603d124bff9203828eb844c551a", "ja": "でも……。\n私らしい表情って言われても、どうすれば……。", "zh": "可是……\n表现出我的特色的表情，要怎么做才能……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_033sih_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_033sih_002_1019_p", "source_sha256": "367dbd12b0ccc238c0950de6fdbb7a25bca740acbf5e74375c5423147c7c78be", "ja": "どうもしなくていいじゃないか？\nカメラマンさんは、何て言ってた？", "zh": "什么都不用做吧？\n刚刚摄影师是怎么说的？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_033sih_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_033sih_002_1020_033sih", "source_sha256": "f35fa6d4f8a908b6dcb3026f8441d90d77dcea8744b8f29644a1260e88dcd2f4", "ja": "……。\n肩の力を抜いて、もう少し楽にして……。", "zh": "……\n摄影师要我肩膀放松，别紧张……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_033sih_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_033sih_002_1021_p", "source_sha256": "2587cb663a2b6198b2d1b8e9d50673c0f661f60ac7a346f4943ffad008d81151", "ja": "なら、そこから始めてみよう。\n求められているものに応えるのが、プロの仕事だろ？", "zh": "那么，就试着从这一点开始吧。\n达成对方的要求，这样才叫专业，不是吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_033sih_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_033sih_002_1023_033sih", "source_sha256": "057250f5da4e7a763a0472086a6686c9834051b80769bc9aac4d7892a244b8d5", "ja": "求められたことに応えるのが、プロ……。\nそれなら、私は……。", "zh": "达成要求才叫专业……\n这样的话，我……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_033sih_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_033sih_002_1024_033sih", "source_sha256": "b2fb33c0b59af4b063997e0198b8903fb40fadb9abe55fa4943ee2875ed8c91c", "ja": "あの、私、撮影に戻ります。\nちょっと確認したいこともあるので。", "zh": "不好意思，我要回去拍摄了。\n有些地方我想要确认一下。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_033sih_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_033sih_002_1025_033sih", "source_sha256": "9b007e7820a7a0f32832b6fec211fc163efafb6b3ac0850f8b983c9b9d95c277", "ja": "私らしい表情。\nそういうことでいいのか、まだわからないけど……。", "zh": "表现出自己特色的表情。\n我还不确定这样可不可行，不过……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_033sih_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_033sih_002_1026_null", "source_sha256": "efc1d82f27c00c2cd66242ba3968b75b5084f0ad635f478df59f2ea4ca40369e", "ja": "そして……", "zh": "然后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_033sih_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_033sih_002_1027_033sih", "source_sha256": "24fd5aaa24eb75146ff8f89d8b588710bb9612101f2c41ead23a0b561127f0be", "ja": "お疲れさまです。写真、どうですか？\n宣材として使えそうですか？", "zh": "辛苦了。请问照片拍得如何呢？\n有办法当作宣传照吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_033sih_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_033sih_002_1028_p", "source_sha256": "b10de921880841df03df0e73e31cfe6da16df01a351cb3d23cb8b42be1486741", "ja": "ああ、バッチリだ。キリッとした表情が志保らしくて、\nすごくいい感じだ。よく頑張ったな！", "zh": "没问题，拍得很棒。坚定的神情很有志保的特色，\n感觉很不错。你做得很好！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_033sih_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_033sih_002_1029_033sih", "source_sha256": "78e378963fe6214e3ab111cf2d70a4abe3decc39592fad9f04980ebd03b01794", "ja": "……まあ、仕事なので。\n上手くいったのなら、よかったです。", "zh": "……嗯，这是工作。\n能够顺利是最好的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_033sih_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_033sih_002_1030_p", "source_sha256": "14602074cf543a8fd427a21df7f6a460cb563618ef88036013f816b99ab1e490", "ja": "（笑顔だけがアイドルじゃない。この写真のように、\n凛とした輝きを、志保なら見せてくれるだろう）", "zh": "（偶像并非只有笑容。就像这张照片一样，\n志保肯定能展现出凛然的光辉吧。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
